  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_subq",
  "prompt": "Yara, in retail operations, is choosing model stores for next year's store targets and asks which physical stores beat the average store in 2025. Leave out the webshop, the store with store_type web. A store's 2025 net revenue is the sum of quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur over the lines of its orders with an order_ts from 2025-01-01 00:00:00 up to but not including 2026-01-01 00:00:00; order_ts holds UTC time. The average store is the average of that net revenue over the physical stores with at least one such order: a store with no 2025 order is not part of it. Return one row for each physical store whose 2025 net revenue is above that average. Return three columns, in this order: store_code, city and net_revenue_eur, not rounded. Sort by store_code, from A to Z.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "store_code",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "city",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "net_revenue_eur",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
